                                    <h1>Digital Identity &amp; eKYC: Enterprise Guide 2026</h1>
                                    <p>Digital identity is the invisible layer under every modern digital service — accounts, payments, healthcare, government. Getting it right unlocks massive UX + operational wins. Getting it wrong creates security + compliance nightmares. Here is a practical guide across India, UAE, USA, UK.</p>
                                    <h2>Regional Digital Identity Infrastructure</h2>
                                    <p><strong>India:</strong> Aadhaar (world's largest biometric ID), DigiLocker (documents), Bharat KYC. eKYC via offline XML or online. 1.3B+ population covered.<br><strong>UAE:</strong> Emirates ID + UAE PASS (unified digital identity). Excellent developer APIs. Growing use across government + private.<br><strong>USA:</strong> Fragmented — SSN + state IDs. Login.gov for federal. ID.me for veterans / state. Private KYC vendors (Persona, Alloy) dominant.<br><strong>UK:</strong> No unified digital ID (yet). Yoti, Onfido, Verify (deprecated) private options.<br><strong>EU:</strong> eIDAS 2.0 rolling out unified European Digital Identity.</p>
                                    <h2>The KYC Vendor Landscape</h2>
                                    <p><strong>India:</strong> Digio, Signeasy, Karza, IDfy, HyperVerge.<br><strong>UAE:</strong> Direct EIDA / UAE PASS integration, plus Onfido, Persona for cross-border.<br><strong>USA:</strong> Persona, Alloy, Onfido, Trulioo, Socure.<br><strong>UK:</strong> Onfido, Yoti, Truework.<br><strong>Global:</strong> Onfido, Trulioo, Sumsub, Ondato.</p>
                                    <h2>Emerging Verifiable Credentials</h2>
                                    <p>Decentralised identity / verifiable credentials (VCs) using W3C DID standards are rolling out — Microsoft Entra Verified ID, EU Digital Identity Wallet, India's DigiLocker VC integration. Long-term shift from centralised KYC verification to user-controlled credentials.</p>
                                    <h2>Cost Bands</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Off-shelf KYC integration:</strong> $0.20-2.50 per verification + platform fees.<br><strong>Custom KYC workflow:</strong> ₹15-45 lakh / $18K-54K one-time.<br><strong>Enterprise identity platform:</strong> ₹1-4 Cr / $120K-480K.</p>
                                    <h2>Fraud Rates by Region</h2>
                                    <p>India: fake documents ~3-8% of attempted KYC. UAE: <2%. USA: synthetic identity fraud rising, 5-12% of attempts. Watch: fraud patterns shift monthly. Continuous model updates + rule tuning required.</p>

