                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Aadhaar eKYC — offline or online?</h3>
                                        <p>Offline XML for most workloads (no need to hit UIDAI infrastructure per verification). Online only when real-time UIDAI check required.</p>
                                        <h3>Which KYC vendor for US market?</h3>
                                        <p>Persona for flexibility, Alloy for banking, Socure for high-volume ID + risk scoring. Compare on your specific fraud profile.</p>
                                        <h3>Can I use Aadhaar eKYC outside financial services?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes, with authorised User Agency status via UIDAI. Requirement varies by use case.</p>
                                        <h3>Are verifiable credentials worth building for now?</h3>
                                        <p>For most: track but don't build yet. Standards are stabilising; enterprise adoption is 2-4 years away for meaningful scale.</p>
